# RNVS E-Commerce Platform

A modern, scalable **multi-vendor e-commerce platform** built with **ASP.NET Core** backend and **Next.js** frontend, following **Clean Architecture** principles.

[![.NET Version](https://img.shields.io/badge/.NET-9.0-purple)](https://dotnet.microsoft.com/)
[![Next.js](https://img.shields.io/badge/Next.js-15-black)](https://nextjs.org/)
[![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-blue.svg)](LICENSE)

