## ?? Features

### **Multi-Vendor Marketplace**
- ? Vendor registration and approval workflow
- ? Custom branding per vendor (logo, colors, themes)
- ? Vendor-specific product management
- ? Commission-based revenue sharing
- ? Independent vendor dashboards

### **Product Management**
- ? Comprehensive product catalog with categories
- ? Multiple product images with image optimization
- ? Inventory tracking and low-stock alerts
- ? Product variants (size, color, etc.)
- ? Product reviews and ratings
- ? Advanced search and filtering

### **Shopping Experience**
- ? Intuitive shopping cart
- ? Wishlist functionality
- ? Guest and registered user checkout
- ? Product recommendations powered by ML.NET
- ? Real-time stock availability
- ? Product comparison

### **Payment & Checkout**
- ? Multiple payment gateways (Stripe, PayPal)
- ? Secure payment processing
- ? Order tracking and history
- ? Custom receipt generation (PDF)
- ? Invoice generation with vendor branding
- ? Refund management

### **Security & Authentication**
- ? JWT-based authentication
- ? Two-factor authentication (TOTP)
- ? Passkey/WebAuthn support
- ? Role-based authorization (Admin, Vendor, Customer)
- ? AES encryption for sensitive data
- ? Secure password hashing (PBKDF2)

### **Advanced Features**
- ? ML-powered product recommendations
- ? Full-text search with Elasticsearch
- ? Redis caching for performance
- ? Email notifications (SMTP, SendGrid)
- ? File storage (Local, Azure Blob, AWS S3)
- ? Shipping provider integrations (FedEx, UPS, BlueDart, Delhivery, DTDC)
- ? Real-time analytics dashboard

